---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About | Carlos Ozuna">
  <div class="container section text-center" style="padding-top: 6rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
    <!-- "about" outline text effect -->
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 15vw, 12rem); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--navy); text-transform: lowercase; margin: 0; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.05em; opacity: 0.2; position: relative; z-index: -1;">
      about
    </h1>
    
    <div style="margin-top: -3rem;">
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin: 0 auto;">
        <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.8;">
    
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Let's Create Something Great Together</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      Hi there! I'm a graphic designer with 20+ years of experience crafting visuals for brands, print media, agencies, and digital platforms. I thrive on collaboration, and my favourite part of the job is turning ideas into designs that truly connect with people.
    </p>

    <h3 style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">What I Bring:</h3>
    <ul style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; list-style-type: disc;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Mastery of Adobe tools (Photoshop, InDesign, Illustrator, Wordpress y CSS) to create polished, versatile work.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">A deep understanding of print and digital design - from magazines and promotional materials to social campaigns and email marketing.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">A humble, team-first mindset. I listen closely, adapt quickly, and believe feedback makes every project stronger.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Fluent communication in English, French, and Spanish, which helps me collaborate smoothly across cultures.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">My Approach:</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      Over the years, I've learned that great design starts with empathy. I ask questions, respect deadlines, and keep things simple and purposeful. Whether it's a logo, a brochure, or a digital ad, my goal is to deliver work that feels both meaningful and effortless.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      If you're looking for a professional graphic designer who loves design (and is excited by well-chosen typography or an engaging layout!), let's talk. I'm open to full-time, freelance, or contract positions where I can contribute, learn, and grow with a caring team.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 5rem;">
      Thanks for your time—I'd be honoured to help bring your company to the next level.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-sm" style="background: #f1f5f9; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Contact Carlos Ozuna</h2>
      
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; max-width: 300px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <a href="/carlos-ozuna-cv.pdf" download class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%; border-color: var(--navy);">Download My CV</a>
        <a href="/work" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%; border-color: var(--navy);">See Carlos Ozuna's Work</a>
        <a href="mailto:contact@ozuna.ca" class="btn btn-gold" style="width: 100%;">Contact Me</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
